 doc+='</tbody></table></div><details><summary>수동 ≤3px 부분집합의 exact/r2 동시 tradeoff</summary><div class="tablewrap"><table class="smalltable"><thead><tr><th>모델 / 군</th><th>D exact→r2 보임</th><th>E exact→r2 보임 오판</th><th>주의</th></tr></thead><tbody>'
